{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Migasira","html":"<article id='thag2.31'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 2.31 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 2.31 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dukanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Twos </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Catutthavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Four </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Migasirattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Migasira </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yato ahaṁ pabbajito, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>When I had gone forth </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sammāsambuddhasāsane; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>in the teaching of the Buddha, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vimuccamāno uggacchiṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>while letting go, I rose up; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kāmadhātuṁ upaccagaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>escaping the sensual realm. </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Brahmuno pekkhamānassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Then, as the supreme one looked on, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>tato cittaṁ vimucci me; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>my mind was freed. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Akuppā me vimuttīti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>My freedom is unshakable </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbasaṁyojanakkhayā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>with the ending of all fetters. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Migasiro thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
